'''Dragon League Swordsman''' (ドラリー剣士 ''Dorarī Kenshi'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Dragon League Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.1.1 Update|Version 3.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dragon League Swordsman
|image = E 122.png
|appearance = [[Dragon League Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 350円 - 1,382円
}}

==Enemy==
A quick-attacking enemy with high DPS and average movement speed. However, due to his pathetic health and range, taking him down isn't anywhere near an issue.

